@startuml
top to bottom direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

rectangle "Presentation Layer\n\nfrmPlaceOrder\nfrmPayment\nfrmDispatchOrder\nfrmCloseDelivery" as UI

rectangle "Business Layer\n\nPizzaBuilder\nPriceCalculator\nOrderFacade\nPayment Strategies\n\nIOrderStore / IDeliveryStore" as Business

rectangle "Data Access Layer\n\nOracleOrderStore\nOracleDeliveryStore" as Data

database "Oracle Database" as DB

UI -down-> Business : uses business operations
Business -down-> Data : saving through interfaces
UI -right-> Data : delivery calls through IDeliveryStore
Data -down-> DB : executes SQL

@enduml